    "blurb": "Barcode generation for Camunda processes",
    "overview": "Generates barcodes directly within a Camunda process, supporting formats including Aztec, Codabar, Code 128, Code 39, Code 93, Data Matrix, EAN-8, EAN-13, ITF, PDF417, QR Code, UPC-A, and UPC-E.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Generate barcodes directly within your process",
    "splashDescription": "Generating barcodes usually means relying on a separate library or service outside your process. This connector generates barcodes directly within your Camunda process, supporting a wide range of formats including Aztec, Codabar, Code 128, Code 39, Code 93, Data Matrix, EAN-8, EAN-13, ITF, PDF417, QR Code, UPC-A, and UPC-E. This lets you produce shipping labels, product codes, or scannable identifiers without adding an external dependency to your process.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/830622/overview/img9672235106410690045.png?40f270c34677505b761dc96b0d99e6ed",
